              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AABBO Waaqi guddaani waan jed'u, lafa aloo fakaatu ta namaafi saa inqamne tana keesa takaa tana marri dansaani iti bahe, tissituuni achiti hori tissiti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Diri lafa gaareenitifi ka lafa golbootifi ka lafa bitaa ta Yudatifi ka lafa Benjaminitifi ollowaani d'aatu Yerusalemutifi dira Yuda keesale, tissituuni akuma duri deebite ree tohati. Nami dubbi tana jed'e, ana AABBO Waaqa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
