          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AABBO Waaqi waan nani jed'e, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atini biyyiti teete, AABBO Waaqi Israelifi Yuda, worra lamaani inni fohate ya lakise jettu ind'ageenne? Tanaafi worri gumi tiyya tufate, gosati worra heregu dide. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammo anini, AABBO Waaqi, yayu halkanifi guyyale wold'aqisa woliini tolfad'e seera lafafi gubbaani gula deemtule tolche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba akuma anini waan kana tolche, akasuma anini wold'aqisa kiyya, ka anini d'aloota Yakobotiifi hojattu tiyya Daudi woliini tolfad'e jabeesa. Anini d'aloota Daudi keesaa nama toko, ka d'aloota Abrahamutifi Isaaqofi Yakobo fidu fohad'a. Anini gumi tiyyaa nahe, worrileeni deebie wo horata.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
